.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# NOTE: config.js is intentionally NOT ignored.
#
# GitHub Pages serves plain static files, so the site can only read
# your Supabase URL + publishable key if they're committed. The
# publishable key is designed to ship in public code — that's the
# whole point of it. Your database is protected by the Row Level
# Security policies in schema.sql, not by hiding this file.
#
# Never commit the SECRET key (sb_secret_...).
